    {
      "text": "his whole heart was filled, 1 Ne. 1:15. worship him with … your whole soul, 2 Ne. 25:29. I did pour out my whole soul unto God, Enos 1:9 (Mosiah 26:14). offer your whole souls as an offering unto him, Omni 1:26. Benjamin, by laboring with … the faculty of his whole soul, W of M 1:18. render all the thanks and praise which your whole soul has power to possess, Mosiah 2:20. if ye should serve him with all your whole souls, Mosiah 2:21. my whole frame doth tremble, Mosiah 2:30. the whole becoming spiritual and immortal, Alma 11:45. this is the whole meaning of the law, Alma 34:14. whole earth did tremble, Alma 36:7 (38:7; 3 Ne. 8:6, 8, 12). whole face of the land was filled with rejoicing, Hel. 11:18 (11:20; Morm. 1:7, 13; 8:8; Ether 10:21; 13:17; 14:21; D&C 1:30). power of his voice doth the whole earth shake, Hel. 12:11. face of the whole earth became deformed, 3 Ne. 8:17. their wickedness, which was above all the wickedness of the whole earth, 3 Ne. 9:9. that ye may know that I am … the God of the whole earth, 3 Ne. 11:14 (22:5). thy whole body shall be full of light, 3 Ne. 13:22. eye be evil, thy whole body shall be full of darkness, 3 Ne. 13:23. they who were whole, bow down at his feet, 3 Ne. 17:10. consecrate their gain … unto the Lord of the whole earth, 3 Ne. 20:19 (D&C 55:1). all stand before the judgment-seat of Christ … the whole human family, Morm. 3:20. little children are whole, Moro. 8:8.",
